614
01:02:24,303 --> 01:02:27,843
浮かぶふわふわな空想 暴走？底なしの本能！
Floating, fluffy daydreams—running wild? Bottomless instinct!

615
01:02:27,843 --> 01:02:30,263
すべて知りたいでしょう？
You want to know everything, right?

616
01:02:41,243 --> 01:02:44,193
Hey guys! 叫べ 気分は最高？
Hey guys! Shout out, is the feeling top-tier?

617
01:02:44,523 --> 01:02:49,963
Come on! もっと叫べ 気分は最高？ 最高！
Come on! Shout more, is the feeling top-tier? Top-tier!

